  Read: a tight SPREAD (esp. the ALL row) means the estimate is stable.
  If STAKES-WEIGHTED sits well above unweighted at a given burst, the
  residual misrankings are low-stakes near-ties -- a wrong Metropolis call
  there costs little, so a smaller burst is adequate in practice.
